#: app.py:108 app.py:1276
msgid ""
"Your account has been blocked. In case this should not be the case, "
"please contact your company admin."
msgstr ""
"Konto zostało zablokowane. Jeśli to pomyłka, prosimy o kontakt z "
"administratorem firmy."

